1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,360
Imagine: nine a.m.

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:15,360
For a Programmatic Solutions Consultant, the day starts underwater: emails, Slack, invites, DSP exports, tickets. All at once.

3
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:21,900
Every answer is already in there, somewhere: in an email, a thread, an export.

4
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:25,640
But no one can see it all.

5
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,460
What if it all flowed into one place?

6
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,680
So we built J.A.R.V.I.S.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:43,160
One AI brain, powered by Kiro, that turns all of that noise into a single place to work.

8
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:49,860
Every morning, a thirty-second briefing tells me where to start: mail, meetings, campaigns.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:56,220
My inbox arrives already sorted: what matters to me comes first.

10
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:01,400
No thread goes cold: every follow-up is one click away.

11
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:12,000
And it writes like me: it learned my style from my emails, and every draft is grounded in real data: DSP results, tickets, documentation.

12
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:20,600
I stay in charge: a quick, messy note, even in French, and it rewrites it cleanly into the email.

13
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:25,180
Every meeting is under control, and forgotten invites resurface.

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:34,580
Even better: a dedicated agent prepares every meeting the day before. Context, numbers, talking points. I walk in ready.

15
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:40,200
On the campaign side, DSP exports feed the brain natively.

16
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:50,140
The pacing map shows at a glance what is slipping. I see under-delivery before my client does.

17
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:59,600
And numbers become actions: two percent delivered, forty-one thousand euros at risk. It is already a task, with the next step.

18
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:06,700
When delivery breaks, troubleshooting is guided: TWIG, Waypoint, the twenty-four-hour window, and every SIM ticket.

19
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:12,740
My whole portfolio is ranked by urgency.

20
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:24,200
One click, and the whole client is in front of me: risk, next step, latest emails, campaigns. On one screen.

21
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:36,060
Seven hundred product updates? Kiro summarizes them, flags what needs action, and prepares a recap every Thursday. Slack is connected: nothing gets lost.

22
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:45,000
And because it knows everything, it produces: one sentence, and my PowerPoint for the team meeting is ready.

23
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:51,260
Even my weekly business review writes itself, from what actually happened this week.

24
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:59,600
I stay in control: drafts land in Outlook, but nothing goes out without me.

25
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:09,640
And it keeps learning: from every email sent, every document created, every campaign result. Its answers and alerts get sharper every day.

26
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:14,920
Next: Salesforce, for sales and targets.

27
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:21,800
Then connected brains, so the whole team moves forward together.

28
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:24,480
Stop searching. Start consulting.

29
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:28,740
J.A.R.V.I.S.: the brain behind every programmatic consultant.
